{"kode":"ELPI","sumber":"Stockbit profile","dipanen_pada":"2026-08-23","address":[{"id":"1000003724","email":["corsec@elpi.co.id"],"fax":"(+62) 31 - 568 0122","npwp":"0015 2833 6994 1000","phone":"(+62) 31 - 568 0121","website":"www.elpi.co.id","key":"","lastupdate":"2025-11-12T10:32:29+07:00","value":"","office":"Graha KCT Lt. 3 \nJl. W.R. Supratman No.23\nSurabaya, Jawa Timur"}],"background":"Perseroan didirikan pada April tahun 1992 di Kota Ambon, Kalimantan Timur bergerak dibidang Pelayaran Rakyat dan Nusantara dengan armada Landing Craft Tank (LCT) 100 dwt bernama LCT EKA. Sampai awal tahun 2000, Perseroan berfokus pada penyediaan solusi logistik ke wilayah timur Indonesia, terutama di Maluku dan Irian Jaya dan di tahun 2002 terdapat penambahan armada LCT bernama EFILYA.\r\n\r\nMenyadari atas perlunya repair & maintenance dalam bisnis pelayaran, pada tahun 2005 telah didirikan perusahaan galangan yang terafiliasi di Samarinda dan perusahaan galangan di Gresik tahun 2012. Hal tersebut memberikan keunggulan kompetitif bagi Perseroan untuk docking dan penyediaan kapal dengan desain struktur & fungsional (custom) yang dibuat menyesuaikan dengan kebutuhan dan daerah operasi client.\r\n\r\nPerseroan semakin tumbuh dan berkembang serta melakukan inovasi, dimana pada tahun 2007 telah mampu membuat serta mengoperasikan kapal aluminium pertama kali dan mendapatkan kontrak pertama dibidang offshore di tahun 2009 pada PT Total E & P Indonesia \r\n\r\nHingga 31 Desember 2021, Perseroan memiliki dan mengoperasikan lebih dari 100 (seratus) unit berbagai macam armada yang terdiri atas Crewboat, Anchor Handling Tug Supply vessel (AHTS), Platform Support Vessel (PSV), Utility Vessel & Specialized Vessel. Dengan dukungan armada diatas Perseroan mampu memberikan layanan dibidang penyewaan kapal, pekerjaan lepas pantai, logistik, Engineering Procurement Construction dan Training & Development\r\n\r\nSaat ini Perseroan telah berkantor pusat di Surabaya, Jawa Timur, memiliki 5 (lima) kantor wilayah & pemeliharaan, Training Center dan Afiliasi Perusahaan Galangan yang mampu memberikan Layanan yang Cakap dan Handal berbasis Safe, Reliable dan Efficient, dalam menyediakan Sustainable Total Marine Solution.","history":{"amount":"222 B","board":"Papan Utama","date":"8 Aug 2022","price":"200","registrar":"","shares":"1,112,000,000","underwriters":["Trimegah Sekuritas Indonesia Tbk."],"administrative_bureau":"PT Adimitra Jasa Korpora","free_float":"15.00%"},"key_executive":{"commissioner":[],"director":[{"id":"21032436","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2026-03-10T21:25:15+07:00","value":"EFILYA KUSUMADEWI"}],"independent_commissioner":[{"id":"21032438","key":"Commissioner (Independent)","lastupdate":"2026-03-10T21:25:15+07:00","value":"FIDA UNIDJAJA"}],"president_commissioner":[{"id":"21032437","key":"President Commissioner","lastupdate":"2026-03-10T21:25:15+07:00","value":"EDWIN SURJALI"}],"president_director":[{"id":"21032435","key":"President Director","lastupdate":"2026-03-10T21:25:15+07:00","value":"EKA TANIPUTRA"}],"vice_president":[],"vice_president_commissioner":[],"independent_vice_president_commissioner":[],"independent_president_commissioner":[]},"secretary":[],"shareholder":[{"percentage":"64.1%","name":"PT KREASI CIPTA TIMUR","value":"6.10 B","badges":[],"id":"0","type":"","location":"","nationality":"","domicile":"","scripless":"","scrip":"","value_formatted":"","classification":""},{"percentage":"18.85%","name":"PT GMT KAPITAL ASIA","value":"1.80 B","badges":[],"id":"0","type":"","location":"","nationality":"","domicile":"","scripless":"","scrip":"","value_formatted":"","classification":""},{"percentage":"16.98%","name":"MASYARAKAT NON WARKAT","value":"1.62 B","badges":[],"id":"0","type":"","location":"","nationality":"","domicile":"","scripless":"","scrip":"","value_formatted":"","classification":""}],"subsidiary":[],"profile":{"fund_type":{"value":"","info":""},"inception_date":"","fund_manager":"","fund_manager_ico":"","custodian_bank"